tu.be/W-R1dzem32s?t=428","https://youtu.be/NmdNvAz08oE?t=125","https://youtu.be/-DN4P92Wp8Y?t=616"]},{"field":"stl","text":"Experts doubt he keeps 1.5 steals. I set it to about 1.4. The base FG% of 46.5 is already below last season's career-best 48.3, so I left FG% alone.","sources":["https://youtu.be/NmdNvAz08oE?t=147","https://youtu.be/-DN4P92Wp8Y?t=616"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"He has persistent knee problems and Cleveland has many back-to-backs. One late rest game, and no shutdown, because the team is contending.","sources":["https://youtu.be/NmdNvAz08oE?t=1909","https://youtu.be/NmdNvAz08oE?t=1907"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}